    },
    "message": "Fix crashes when a generated Scenario has entered food and water stock\n\nRuns of generated Scenarios with entered initial stock stopped during\nstate validation or route planning. Three independent faults:\n\n- A resource stall record kept pointing at an Agent after need-weighted\n  reordering or after that head left the queue. The stall is now dropped\n  when its Agent no longer heads the queue; history is kept.\n- Agents already in a facility's zone record in_room_route_available or\n  room_route_blocked, which validation rejected. Validation now accepts\n  these two outcome pairs.\n- In-room waypoints are de-duplicated on rounded coordinates, so a\n  corner or door node could replace the start or destination and the\n  search raised StopIteration. The endpoints are restored after\n  de-duplication; without a collision the node list is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
